{"id":"ec9c5ea8f25fc47b","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-ordinal-power-step.md","title":"ZFC Ordinal Power Step","display":"df-zfc-ordinal-power-step — ZFC Ordinal Power Step","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ordinal-power-step","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ordinal-power-step"],"display":"df-zfc-ordinal-power-step — ZFC Ordinal Power Step","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ordinal-power-step"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ordinal-power-step</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ordinal-power-step — ZFC Ordinal Power Step"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in V\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in V\\)</span> (base, exponent, and successor-power value)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrdinalPowerStep}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OrdinalPowerStep}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}power\\text{-}step} \\vdash \\mathrm{OrdinalPowerStep}_S(\\gamma,\\alpha,\\beta)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\gamma=\\alpha^{\\beta\\cup\\{\\beta\\}}=\\alpha^\\beta\\cdot\\alpha\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}power\\text{-}step} \\vdash \\mathrm{OrdinalPowerStep}_S(\\gamma,\\alpha,\\beta)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\gamma=\\alpha^{\\beta\\cup\\{\\beta\\}}=\\alpha^\\beta\\cdot\\alpha\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the successor clause for ordinal exponentiation; the successor ordinal is written set-theoretically.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrdinalPowerStep}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}power\\text{-}step} \\vdash \\mathrm{OrdinalPowerStep}_S(\\gamma,\\alpha,\\beta)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\gamma=\\alpha^{\\beta\\cup\\{\\beta\\}}=\\alpha^\\beta\\cdot\\alpha","display":true}],"bytes":894,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2983","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-ordinal-power-step.md|58-df-zfc-ordinal-power-step]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["5582a281f15a33c2"]}